=== INFO ===
Create a choose-your-own adventure website with the following:

- At least 3 pages
- At least 1 custom font
- At least 1 image

Afterwards, we’ll launch this as a real website!

- Create an account on [Github](https://github.com/signup)
- Download [GitHub Desktop](https://desktop.github.com/download/)
- Download [Visual Studio Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/)
- Download the [Live Server extension](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=ritwickdey.LiveServer) for Visual Studio Code

